# Purpose
Helps users prepare presentations around audience, main message, slide purpose,
simple structure, and early conclusions.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with the audience.
- Define the main message.
- Choose the purpose of each slide.
- Use a simple structure.
- Put the conclusion early.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Do not invent audience needs or claims that are not supported by the supplied
  material.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
